# Generated renders are never source files.
out
renders

# whisper.cpp build and models, downloaded on demand.
.whisper

# Narration and recording stems.
#
# The content licence excludes narration recordings, and these run to about
# 300 MB across the raw takes, the noise-reduced passes and the masters. The
# caption JSON beside them IS committed: every animation in every scene is
# timed off those files, so the project does not build without them.
#
# See "Narration audio" in README.md for how to render without the stems.
curriculum/**/audio/*.m4a
curriculum/**/audio/*.wav
curriculum/**/audio/clean/
curriculum/**/audio/master/
# A symlink to the masters locally. Not shipped: the target is ignored, so a
# clone would get a dangling link. Written without a trailing slash so it
# matches the symlink as well as a real directory.
public/narration

# Local tooling state and personal agent workflow, not project configuration.
.serena/
.agents/
